"tr-01": {
"kind": "translate",
"text": "昨日買った本、もう読み終わっちゃった。"
},
"tr-02": {
"kind": "translate",
"text": "お忙しいところ恐縮ですが、資料をご確認いただけますでしょうか。"
},
"tr-03": {
"kind": "translate",
"text": "この案件は猫の手も借りたいほど忙しい。"
},
"tr-04": {
"kind": "translate",
"text": "袋はご入り用ですか。――いえ、結構です。"
},
"tr-05": {
"kind": "translate",
"text": "会場まで駅から徒歩約15分、収容人数は1,200人です。"
},
"tr-06": {
"kind": "translate",
"text": "Let's call it a day and pick this up tomorrow morning."
},
"tr-07": {
"kind": "translate",
"text": "Would you mind sending me the updated schedule by Friday?"
},
"tr-08": {
"kind": "translate",
"text": "Oh great, another meeting that could have been an email."
},
"tr-09": {
"kind": "translate",
"text": "The function returns None if the input list is empty."
},
"tr-10": {
"kind": "translate",
"text": "Although the weather forecast predicted rain, the festival went ahead as planned and drew a larger crowd than last year."
}
